#
#   page_2 - Web::Page: non-blocking dialogs, clipboard requests, the registered media and
#   canvas elements, the media context menu, the user style sheet, selection, find in page and
#   the pending fullscreen operations
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of Libraries/LibWeb/Page/Page.cpp lines 451-1074 (did_request_color_picker through
#       set_viewport_is_fullscreen) with the remaining inline accessors of Page.h. The IPC
#       encode/decode of MediaContextMenu (lines 1076-1102) belongs to the IPC layer, which
#       phase 1 does not have.
